Telegram Desktop native Ubuntu 26.04 LTS source build.

Complete source inputs, bundled dependency sources, build-toolchain archives,
and Debian packaging recipes are provided by the source package in OBS:
https://build.opensuse.org/package/show/home:dwolfF:telegram/telegram-desktop

Packaging and patches:
https://github.com/lmdeuser/telegram-desktop-ubuntu-native

Upstream:
https://github.com/telegramdesktop/tdesktop/releases/tag/v7.4.6

Native hardware video decoding defaults to enabled on Linux. The upstream backend
selector and software fallback are preserved. Hardware and driver support varies.
Existing user preferences are not overwritten by the new default.
